Adaptation 12-upstream-reframe-and-hygiene

Added here, not in the fork:
- Keeps explicit-only invocation for `/reframe`, originally imported from cursor/plugins@9e278fe
  (pstack 0.15.48). The port now supplies the skill body and poteto-help row.
- Removes the two mentions of excluded `poteto-mode/references/dsh-tools.md` (DeepSeek disabled).
- Tightens `typescript-best-practices` and `how` descriptions to prevent false triggers on trivial
  copy edits and general conceptual explanations.
- Aligns `poteto-mode/worker.md` with adaptation 01's local-only autonomy boundary.

Applies to the port's plugins/pstack/skills tree after the patches numbered before it.

Rebased to port commit 1ab6b82.

